<div style="max-width:68ch">
  <p>I'm <strong>Lieyabull</strong> — also around as Still, Stillfox, or BenJooYT. I make browser games, Minecraft things (plugins, bots, automation), and small technical experiments, some finished and some not.</p>
  <p>This site is my den: one shelf for the games, one bench for the bigger builds, one drawer for the half-done notes, and a <a href="/now/">now page</a> so you can see what's actually on the table. If something here is a placeholder, it says so.</p>
  <p>Find the code on <a href="https://github.com/BenJooYT">GitHub ↗</a> and the playable games at <a href="{{ site.arcadeUrl }}">the arcade ↗</a>.</p>
